WEBVTT

00:32:59.538 --> 00:33:03.996
And so, yeah, when I got divorced
right before I went to hike on

00:33:03.996 --> 00:33:09.163
the Pacific Crest Trail in 1995, I
was getting divorced like 94, 95.

00:33:09.329 --> 00:33:10.829
I realized that. Yeah. So.

00:33:11.663 --> 00:33:14.788
I had to set my life on a new course,
which was really the old course,

00:33:14.788 --> 00:33:17.496
which was the course, you know,
way back, you know,

00:33:17.496 --> 00:33:20.246
when I was like hiding Jane Eyre
in 10th grade or whatever.

00:33:20.246 --> 00:33:23.704
I think now those plans for myself,
I took a little detour,

00:33:24.538 --> 00:33:28.454
did some other things, and then I was like
, OK, this is, you know, life.

00:33:28.496 --> 00:33:31.829
My mother's dead. My first
marriage is over.